    "blurb": "Seamless Odoo ERP workflow integration",
    "overview": "Connect Camunda processes to Odoo 19 ERP. Supports CRUD operations, search, webhooks, and polling for seamless business process automation.",
    "rating": null,
    "reviewCount": 0,
    "mobileBundleId": null,
    "mobileAppStoreId": null
  },
  "overview": {
    "splashTitle": "Connect Camunda to Odoo ERP",
    "splashDescription": "This production-ready Camunda connector enables teams to integrate Camunda processes with Odoo 19's External JSON-2 API. This connector enables seamless bi-directional communication between Camunda-based processes and Odoo ERP systems. The outbound connector supports full create, read, update, and delete (CRUD) operations, advanced search with domain filters, pagination, sorting, and custom method execution on any Odoo model. The inbound connector offers both real-time webhook mode for instant event notifications and polling mode for periodic record monitoring. Built with Java 21 and designed for Camunda 8.9+, this connector uses Odoo's modern REST-like JSON-2 API with robust error handling, automatic retries, and comprehensive logging.",
    "imageUrl": "https://d3bql97l1ytoxn.cloudfront.net/app_resources/775040/overview/img18098566625798807980.png?62221811399496b2ff1e816732de91d6",
